# infiniband perftest
https://github.com/linux-rdma/perftest
ib_atomic_bw - client/server Calculates BW of RDMA Atomic transactions between a pair of machines
ib_atomic_lat - client/server Calculates latency of RDMA Atomic transaction of message_size between a pair of machines
ib_read_bw - client/server Calculates BW of RDMA read between a pair of machines. Read available only in RC connection mode
ib_read_lat - client/server Calculates latency of RDMA read operation of message_size between a pair of machines. perform a ping pong benchmark
ib_send_bw - client/server Calculates BW of SEND between a pair of machines. supports Bidirectional (simul send/rcv), change of MTU size, tx size, number of iteration, message size,etc
ib_send_lat - client/server Calculates latency of sending packet in message_size between a pair of machines. perform a ping pong benchmark
ib_write_bw - client/server Calculates BW of RDMA write between pair of machines.supports features such as Bidirectional, etc.
ib_write_lat - client/server Calculates the latency of RDMA write operation of message_size between a pair of machines.
raw_ethernet_bw - client/server Calculates the BW of SEND between a pair of machines.
raw_ethernet_lat - client/server Calculates the latency of sending a packet in message_size between a pair of machines. ping pong benchmark on which you send packet only if you receive one

